# Manual backup copy of results/
results copy/
quick_run/
generalization/
data/moleculeace/_source/

# Per-document latexmk transcripts. build.sh writes these to build/; any left in logs/ are residue of an
# older version of the script that wrote them there.
logs/*_build.log

# One master transcript per pipeline invocation: it repeats every step's own log, a run of the whole pipeline writes
# tens of MB of them, and the next run supersedes it. The per-step logs in logs/*.log stay versioned, because those
# are the record of what actually ran.
logs/master_pipeline_*.log
